55
00:03:30,859 --> 00:03:33,529
Reynaldo terus mengoceh
bahwa Nakali itu tak ada.

56
00:03:33,696 --> 00:03:35,239
Dasar bloon.

57
00:03:35,322 --> 00:03:36,198
Ya.

58
00:03:36,407 --> 00:03:37,700
Lebih parah lagi,

59
00:03:37,783 --> 00:03:39,451
Pak Lopez malah setuju dengannya,

60
00:03:39,535 --> 00:03:40,995
