71
00:04:00,764 --> 00:04:02,182
Pengeluaran isi perut!

72
00:04:04,893 --> 00:04:06,729
Kau anak baru, ya?

73
00:04:06,770 --> 00:04:10,858
Ya, aku sempat berselisih
dengan para suster di sekolah lamaku.

74
00:04:11,066 --> 00:04:12,901
Jadi, beginilah.

75
00:04:12,985 --> 00:04:13,861
Aku Jo.

76
00:04:14,069 --> 00:04:15,779
Aku Raissa.

77
00:04:17,239 --> 00:04:21,035
Aku menantikan pengalaman
zona cipratan berikutnya.

78
00:04:21,243 --> 00:04:22,745
Sayang sekali.

79
00:04:22,953 --> 00:04:24,330
Aku tak akan lama di sini.

80
00:04:24,413 --> 00:04:25,831
Ayahku di Amerika.

81
00:04:25,998 --> 00:04:28,000
Dia janji segera
membawaku dan Nenek ke sana.

82
00:04:29,710 --> 00:04:31,003
Oke.

83
00:04:34,715 --> 00:04:35,549
Ha!

84
