Aku juga.

95
00:05:04,495 --> 00:05:07,247
Mau main ke rumahku
dan dengar cerita lola-ku?

96
00:05:07,456 --> 00:05:08,874
Tayo na (Ayo).

97
00:05:10,209 --> 00:05:11,502
Tayo na.

98
00:05:12,544 --> 00:05:15,130
