untuk masa depanku.

247
00:12:15,926 --> 00:12:18,011
Itu... seru sekali.

248
00:12:18,094 --> 00:12:19,262
Ayamnya.

249
00:12:19,471 --> 00:12:22,265
Jadi, kau tak apa-apa?

250
00:12:22,390 --> 00:12:23,642
Kau bercanda?

251
00:12:23,809 --> 00:12:24,893
Selamat.

252
00:12:25,018 --> 00:12:26,478
Kau akan ke Amerika.

253
00:12:26,561 --> 00:12:28,897
Jo, ayamnya!

254
00:12:29,064 --> 00:12:31,399
Astaga, ayamnya!

255
00:12:32,859 --> 00:12:33,985
Ya.

256
00:12:34,945 --> 00:12:37,447
Semua orang selalu pergi.

257
00:12:40,116 --> 00:12:41,409
Tapi aku ikut senang.

258
00:12:41,535 --> 00:12:43,620
Kalau aku jenius seperti Raissa,

259
00:12:43,787 --> 00:12:46,164
aku juga akan meninggalkan diriku.

260
00:12:49,543 --> 00:12:51,002
Aku rindu Lola.

261
00:12:52,045 --> 00:12:53,964
Ya sudah, aku harus pergi.

262
00:12:54,130 --> 00:12:56,424
Aku serius dengan kerja baru ini.

263
00:13:02,931 --> 00:13:04,266
Sayang Lola.

264
00:13:04,474 --> 00:13:06,059
Jangan berhenti percaya.

265
00:13:21,283 --> 00:13:23,201
Dia pintar sekali.

266
00:13:23,368 --> 00:13:25,245
Semua kampus menginginkannya.

267
00:13:25,453 --> 00:13:27,914
Pokoknya, makanya kupilih Caltech.

268
00:13:27,998 --> 00:13:29,499
Kampus itu punya jalur langsung

269
00:13:29,666 --> 00:13:31,543
ke Jet Propulsion Laboratory NASA.

270
00:13:31,626 --> 00:13:32,794
Hebat, 'kan?

271
00:13:33,753 --> 00:13:35,255
Jadi, Hollywood, ya?

272
00:13:35,380 --> 00:13:36,715
Yah...

273
00:13:36,840 --> 00:13:37,924
Siapa tahu kau menikahi
aktor macam Tom Cruise!

274
00:13:38,049 --> 00:13:39,885
Dia ganteng sekali.

275
00:13:39,968 --> 00:13:41,428
Dan kaya!

276
00:13:41,595 --> 00:13:43,054
Hei, dengar itu?
Raissa akan mengenalkan kita

277
00:13:43,096 --> 00:13:44,514
pada Tom Cruise saat
dia pindah ke Hollywood!

278
00:13:44,681 --> 00:13:46,892
Jo sudah datang?

279
00:13:50,312 --> 00:13:51,521
Sini, sini, aku turun di sini!

280
00:13:51,688 --> 00:13:52,939
Hei, ini bukan tumpanganmu!

281
00:13:52,981 --> 00:13:54,190
Wah!

282
00:13:54,357 --> 00:13:55,609
Terima kasih!

283
00:13:55,692 --> 00:13:57,151
SELAMAT, RAISSA.
KAMI SAYANG KAU

284
00:13:55,692 --> 00:13:58,028
Wah!

285
00:13:57,152 --> 00:13:58,193
SEMOGA SUKSES DI CALTECH!

286
00:13:58,069 --> 00:13:59,529
- Aku tak apa-apa.
- Hore!

287
00:13:59,738 --> 00:14:00,864
- Ate (Kakak) Jo datang!
- Hai, Ate Jo!

288
00:14:01,072 --> 00:14:02,282
Ini dia.
Semua kesukaan kalian.

289
00:14:02,407 --> 00:14:03,825
- Yum Yum Bird!
- Sini ayamnya.

290
00:14:03,909 --> 00:14:06,119
Kak Jo, ceritakan kisah Nakali lagi, dong.

291
00:14:06,244 --> 00:14:08,288
Aduh, jangan sekarang.
Aku harus cari Raissa.

292
00:14:08,413 --> 00:14:09,706
Ayo, cerita.

293
00:14:09,789 --> 00:14:11,833
Janji, kali ini kami tak akan takut.

294
00:14:11,875 --> 00:14:13,960
Tidak. Aku tak bisa...

295
00:14:14,127 --> 00:14:16,338
Tapi buaian bayi itu kosong.

296
00:14:16,421 --> 00:14:18,381
Yang tersisa di kamar itu hanyalah

297
00:14:18,548 --> 00:14:19,883
manananggal haus darah!

298
00:14:22,344 --> 00:14:24,054
Maaf, maaf.

299
00:14:24,179 --> 00:14:25,138
Maaf, Kuya.
(Kak)

300
00:14:25,221 --> 00:14:26,890
Hei, Jo, ada lechon.
(Babi guling)

301
00:14:28,558 --> 00:14:29,643
Raissa?

302
00:14:31,811 --> 00:14:35,482
Serius? Tak ada yang lihat
Raissa di pesta untuk Raissa?

303
00:14:35,607 --> 00:14:37,609
Raissa! Siapa saja!

304
00:14:37,734 --> 00:14:39,319
- Makan dulu. Ada lechon.
- Sudah tahu.

305
00:14:39,361 --> 00:14:41,571
Aku sudah dengar soal...

306
00:14:41,613 --> 00:14:42,614
Lechon.

307
00:14:44,282 --> 00:14:47,327
Ya.

308
00:14:47,494 --> 00:14:48,870
Apa kabar, Yesus?

309
00:14:49,037 --> 00:14:50,580
Kau lihat Raissa?

310
00:14:51,998 --> 00:14:52,999
Makasih, deh.

311
00:14:56,628 --> 00:14:58,421
Halo, Tita.
(Tante)

312
00:14:58,505 --> 00:14:59,714
Salim.

313
00:14:59,881 --> 00:15:01,466
Tita lihat Raissa?

314
00:15:01,633 --> 00:15:03,009
Maverick bisa segalanya.

315
00:15:03,093 --> 00:15:04,427
Itu ulah Jo!

316
00:15:04,511 --> 00:15:06,096
Kenapa dia berpakaian ayam?

317
00:15:06,179 --> 00:15:07,639
Raissa berbakat sekali.

318
00:15:07,764 --> 00:15:09,140
Dia seperti kalkulator
berjalan yang cantik.

319
00:15:10,517 --> 00:15:12,268
Terima kasih,

320
00:15:18,233 --> 00:15:20,735
Suara malaikat.

321
00:15:22,779 --> 00:15:25,657
Kau pasti bisa, bung!

322
00:15:25,782 --> 00:15:26,658
SKOR
100%

323
00:15:26,991 --> 00:15:28,325
SKOR
101%

324
00:15:28,243 --> 00:15:30,161
Yeah! Oke, oke.

325
00:15:30,328 --> 00:15:31,663
Permisi. Ayam raksasa mau lewat.

326
00:15:31,788 --> 00:15:34,332
Terima kasih sudah datang
ke konser karaokeku.

327
00:15:34,457 --> 00:15:36,459
Bercanda.

328
00:15:36,626 --> 00:15:38,795
Kita di sini merayakan Raissa,

329
00:15:38,962 --> 00:15:41,006
- jenius Caltech kita.
- Minggir.

330
00:15:41,172 --> 00:15:43,800
Otaknya menurun dari ibunya, kan?

331
00:15:43,925 --> 00:15:45,260
Begitu juga rambut indahnya.

332
00:15:45,427 --> 00:15:46,886
Cantik.

333
00:15:47,012 --> 00:15:48,555
Lucu sekali, Tita!

334
00:15:48,596 --> 00:15:49,848
Bercanda saja...

335
00:15:49,973 --> 00:15:51,349
...kami bangga padamu, Raissa.

336
00:15:51,516 --> 00:15:53,351
Besok jam segini, kau sudah

337
00:15:53,560 --> 00:15:55,395
menuju Amerika, jauh dari rumah.

338
00:15:57,105 --> 00:15:58,648
Maaf, ada sesuatu di mataku.

339
00:15:58,815 --> 00:16:00,108
- Dan di hatiku.
- Aw.

340
00:16:00,316 --> 00:16:01,526
Aduh, Papa.

341
00:16:01,735 --> 00:16:05,113
Dan sekarang, untuk menghormati
Raissa, tayangan slide!

342
00:16:05,238 --> 00:16:06,865
Aw.

343
00:16:06,781 --> 00:16:07,991
BAYI KAMI

344
00:16:08,033 --> 00:16:10,285
Ay nako.

345
00:16:10,326 --> 00:16:12,579
Tenang, Kawan.

346
00:16:14,205 --> 00:16:15,665
Hah?

347
00:16:18,501 --> 00:16:20,211
Ayo, Jo. Ayo, Jo.

348
00:16:26,760 --> 00:16:27,635
Lechon-ku!

349
00:16:27,802 --> 00:16:28,928
Jangan panik!

350
00:16:40,148 --> 00:16:42,233
Tapi ini malam terakhir kami.

351
00:16:42,400 --> 00:16:45,111
Mama tak peduli.
Kau tak boleh pergi dengan Jo.

352
00:16:45,278 --> 00:16:46,154
Ma!

353
00:16:46,321 --> 00:16:47,947
Bagus, sekarang macet.

354
00:16:47,989 --> 00:16:49,616
Ini pernah kau cuci, tidak?

355
00:16:49,824 --> 00:16:51,910
Ma, kami cuma nongkrong,
bukan merampok bank.

356
00:16:51,993 --> 00:16:53,578
Kau lupa soal

357
00:16:53,745 --> 00:16:55,163
insiden militer dengan misil itu?

358
00:16:55,371 --> 00:16:56,915
Roket itulah yang membuat

359
00:16:57,123 --> 00:16:58,625
Caltech melirikku sejak awal.

360
00:16:58,833 --> 00:17:00,001
Roket, roket.

361
00:17:00,043 --> 00:17:01,419
Intinya, Mama mau memastikan

362
00:17:01,586 --> 00:17:03,046
kau sungguh sampai di Caltech...

363
00:17:03,254 --> 00:17:04,881
...bukan di penjara dengan Jo.

364
00:17:05,048 --> 00:17:06,758
Serius, Ma?

365
00:17:06,841 --> 00:17:08,051
Penjara?

366
00:17:08,218 --> 00:17:10,011
Raissa, kami sayang Jo.

367
00:17:10,178 --> 00:17:13,014
Tapi kau ini... seperti roket.

368
00:17:13,139 --> 00:17:15,683
Jo itu seperti... batu.

369
00:17:15,809 --> 00:17:17,435
Bukan, lebih seperti bongkahan.

370
00:17:17,560 --> 00:17:20,980
Mama memang tak kuliah
di Caltech, tapi coba jawab:

371
00:17:21,022 --> 00:17:25,860
Seberapa tinggi roket bisa terbang
dengan batu besar terikat padanya?

372
00:17:25,985 --> 00:17:27,112
Cukup tinggi, malah,

373
00:17:27,237 --> 00:17:28,655
tergantung massa batunya.

374
00:17:28,780 --> 00:17:33,618
Dengar, duniamu semakin luas, Raissa.

375
00:17:33,701 --> 00:17:35,120
Teman datang dan pergi.

376
00:17:35,286 --> 00:17:39,124
Kau harus fokus pada masa
depanmu yang cerah.

377
00:17:43,336 --> 00:17:44,838
Baik, Ma.

378
00:17:45,046 --> 00:17:46,381
Mama benar.

379
00:17:46,464 --> 00:17:47,924
Itulah jenius Caltech-ku.

380
00:17:48,049 --> 00:17:49,759
Mama mau menarik papamu dari karaoke...

381
00:17:51,302 --> 00:17:52,512
...kalau tidak, dia di sana sampai besok.

382
00:17:52,679 --> 00:17:54,347
Hei, Manny!

383
00:17:54,430 --> 00:17:55,890
Gantian dengan yang lain!

384
00:17:56,057 --> 00:17:57,934
Jadi...

385
00:17:58,017 --> 00:17:59,686
...siapa yang siap untuk malam terbaik?

386
00:17:59,727 --> 00:18:01,271
Jo, aku tak boleh keluar.

387
00:18:01,479 --> 00:18:03,857
- Apa?
- Mamaku bilang, kukutip,

388
00:18:03,898 --> 00:18:05,942
"Tiket ke Amerika ini percuma

389
00:18:06,067 --> 00:18:07,318
kalau dipenjara bersama Jo, ya?"

390
00:18:07,443 --> 00:18:08,611
Maksudmu tiket ini?

391
00:18:08,736 --> 00:18:10,405
Jo, kembalikan.

392
00:18:10,572 --> 00:18:12,198
- Ayolah.
- Ada Cheezin' Flame-O's.

393
00:18:12,240 --> 00:18:13,908
Jo, aku tak boleh keluar.

394
00:18:14,033 --> 00:18:15,201
Dan minuman energi!

395
00:18:15,326 --> 00:18:17,120
Jo, aku tak boleh keluar!

396
00:18:19,289 --> 00:18:22,500
Gawat, ada yang keluar rumah.

397
00:18:23,584 --> 00:18:24,210
SEGERA KEMBALI!

398
00:18:26,713 --> 00:18:28,339
CHEEZIN' FLAME-O'S
CRIMSON COW

399
00:18:29,174 --> 00:18:30,341
Bum!

400
00:18:30,550 --> 00:18:31,801
Wah!

401
00:18:31,885 --> 00:18:33,303
Apa?!

402
00:18:33,386 --> 00:18:35,805
Sahabat selamanya!

403
00:18:35,930 --> 00:18:38,057
- Ya. Oke, oke.
- Ayo.

404
00:18:40,685 --> 00:18:42,020
Yes...!

405
00:18:42,228 --> 00:18:43,813
Wah...!

406
00:18:55,450 --> 00:18:56,826
Karaoke bareng Lola paling seru.

407
00:18:56,910 --> 00:18:58,953
Ya.

408
00:19:00,538 --> 00:19:03,458
Kau tahu, kau tak perlu jauh-jauh

409
00:19:03,499 --> 00:19:05,293
ke Amerika untuk sekolah.

410
00:19:07,295 --> 00:19:08,463
Kita sudah bahas ini.

411
00:19:08,588 --> 00:19:10,757
Itu keinginan orang tuaku.

412
00:19:10,840 --> 00:19:12,425
Bukan mereka yang memutuskan.

413
00:19:12,634 --> 00:19:13,801
Ini hidupmu.

414
00:19:15,470 --> 00:19:16,888
Lalu hidupmu sendiri?

415
00:19:16,971 --> 00:19:18,556
Maksudmu apa?

416
00:19:18,723 --> 00:19:20,683
Aku wajah restoran cepat saji besar.

417
00:19:20,850 --> 00:19:22,185
Kau tak perlu mengkhawatirkanku.

418
00:19:22,310 --> 00:19:24,687
Justru itu yang membuatku khawatir, Jo.

419
00:19:24,854 --> 00:19:28,233
Kau seniman yang luar biasa berbakat,

420
00:19:28,358 --> 00:19:29,943
tapi bakatmu kau biarkan saja.

421
00:19:29,984 --> 00:19:34,572
Kau cuma terus menggambar
hal-hal Nakali yang itu-itu saja.

422
00:19:34,072 --> 00:19:35,155
NAKALI ATAU TIDAK SAMA SEKALI

423
00:19:34,697 --> 00:19:39,244
Kita bukan anak kecil lagi, Jo, dan aku...

424
00:19:39,369 --> 00:19:41,663
tak akan ada di sini untuk membantumu.

425
00:19:41,829 --> 00:19:43,873
Aku tahu. Kau roket.

426
00:19:55,218 --> 00:19:56,678
Kita harus pulang.

427
00:19:56,761 --> 00:20:00,515
Tunggu. Ayo tambah satu jimat lagi.

428
00:20:01,516 --> 00:20:03,643
Jo, aku... tak bisa memakai ini.

429
00:20:03,685 --> 00:20:05,311
Ayolah, ikat saja sumbunya.

430
00:20:05,353 --> 00:20:07,730
Aku tak bisa bawa bahan
peledak naik pesawat.

431
00:20:07,855 --> 00:20:09,399
Sini, biar kuikatkan.

432
00:20:09,440 --> 00:20:11,317
Aku tak butuh kau mengikatkannya.

433
00:20:11,359 --> 00:20:12,902
Aku butuh kau mendengarkanku.

434
00:20:12,944 --> 00:20:15,363
Aku dengar, tapi kau konyol.

435
00:20:15,488 --> 00:20:16,948
Bukan, ini yang konyol.

436
00:20:18,157 --> 00:20:19,617
Bagus.

437
00:20:36,718 --> 00:20:38,928
Ayo, Jo. Aku harus pulang.

438
00:20:42,515 --> 00:20:45,810
Raissa, kau tak akan percaya ini.

439
00:20:47,353 --> 00:20:48,896
Lihat!

440
00:20:48,980 --> 00:20:50,606
Mustahil.

441
00:20:59,240 --> 00:21:00,867
Jo!

442
00:21:17,091 --> 00:21:19,594
- Ini nyata?
- Ini nyata!

443
00:21:19,761 --> 00:21:21,054
Ini nyata!

444
00:21:22,764 --> 00:21:24,766
Ini terowongan kuantum.

445
00:21:24,932 --> 00:21:25,808
Baiklah, ayo.

446
00:21:25,933 --> 00:21:26,934
Tunggu, apa?

447
00:21:27,060 --> 00:21:28,978
Tak bisa. Kita tidak akan...

448
00:21:29,103 --> 00:21:30,646
Kita harus.

449
00:21:30,772 --> 00:21:33,858
Waktu kecil, kita berjanji
akan menemukan Nakali.

450
00:21:33,941 --> 00:21:35,693
Ini takdir!

451
00:21:35,777 --> 00:21:37,904
Tidak. Mustahil.

452
00:21:39,864 --> 00:21:41,199
Tayo na.

453
00:21:44,452 --> 00:21:46,037
Tayo na!

454
00:21:49,248 --> 00:21:50,875
Satu.

455
00:21:53,586 --> 00:21:55,171
Dua.

456
00:21:57,215 --> 00:21:58,591
- Tunggu, bisa kita bicarakan dulu?
- Tiga!

457
00:22:04,222 --> 00:22:05,765
Wild Pack!

458
00:22:05,890 --> 00:22:08,184
- Semuanya, nyanyi!
- ...kalian tak perlu pergi.

459
00:22:19,403 --> 00:22:21,864
SEGERA KEMBALI!

460
00:22:23,032 --> 00:22:26,369
RUMAH SAKIT PORTABEL RAISSA

461
00:22:59,152 --> 00:23:00,611
Wah.

462
00:23:11,456 --> 00:23:12,623
Raissa.

463
00:23:12,790 --> 00:23:14,417
- Aduh.
- Kau harus lihat.

464
00:23:14,500 --> 00:23:16,294
Apa?

465
00:23:16,377 --> 00:23:18,463
Kita di mana?

466
00:23:18,504 --> 00:23:20,590
Nakali.

467
00:23:20,631 --> 00:23:22,258
Nakali!

468
00:23:22,341 --> 00:23:23,342
Kita berhasil!

469
00:23:23,551 --> 00:23:25,261
Kami berhasil, Lola!

470
00:23:25,386 --> 00:23:26,721
Yeah! Hore!

471
00:23:26,888 --> 00:23:28,389
Aku tak percaya!

472
00:23:28,514 --> 00:23:30,057
Aku berlari di Nakali!

473
00:23:30,224 --> 00:23:31,601
Rasakan itu, Reynaldo!

474
00:23:31,726 --> 00:23:33,019
Yeah!

475
00:23:34,520 --> 00:23:35,480
Rambutmu!

476
00:23:35,563 --> 00:23:37,565
Kenapa rambutku?

477
00:23:44,238 --> 00:23:45,740
Mama bakal membunuhku!

478
00:23:45,948 --> 00:23:47,366
Cuma hilang sedikit rambut.

479
00:23:47,575 --> 00:23:48,743
Nanti tumbuh lagi.

480
00:23:48,784 --> 00:23:50,828
Norke-ku hilang!

481
00:23:52,914 --> 00:23:54,040
Tunggu.

482
00:23:54,123 --> 00:23:55,291
Kenapa bokongmu gosong?

483
00:23:55,416 --> 00:23:56,959
Entahlah.

484
00:23:57,084 --> 00:23:58,169
Kenapa kau berlumur sampah?

485
00:23:59,712 --> 00:24:01,172
Itu mahkota?

486
00:24:02,673 --> 00:24:04,342
Galing!

487
00:24:05,218 --> 00:24:08,095
Tunggu. Berarti aku bangsawan Nakali?

488
00:24:09,639 --> 00:24:10,765
Jam 07.00 pagi?

489
00:24:10,848 --> 00:24:13,392
- Ada yang tak beres.
- Apa?

490
00:24:13,518 --> 00:24:16,854
Jam 07.00 malam saat
kita masuk portal semalam.

491
00:24:16,896 --> 00:24:18,397
Portal.

492
00:24:18,606 --> 00:24:19,982
Kedengarannya keren.

493
00:24:20,024 --> 00:24:23,236
Jo, kita lewat portal itu 12 jam lalu,

494
00:24:23,277 --> 00:24:25,154
dan aku tak ingat apa pun soal semalam.

495
00:24:25,238 --> 00:24:26,364
Kau ingat?

496
00:24:28,157 --> 00:24:31,744
Tidak, tapi sepertinya
kita bersenang-senang.

497
00:24:31,953 --> 00:24:32,954
Itu bokong?

498
00:24:33,162 --> 00:24:35,748
Aku harus mengejar pesawat malam ini.

499
00:24:35,957 --> 00:24:37,124
Dolar pasir itu.

500
00:24:37,166 --> 00:24:39,043
