744
00:34:50,195 --> 00:34:51,655
SEGERA KEMBALI!

745
00:34:51,738 --> 00:34:53,031
Oh, Nak.

746
00:34:53,240 --> 00:34:55,117
Tolong kembalilah.

747
00:34:58,829 --> 00:35:00,706
Hei, tunggu aku!

748
00:35:00,831 --> 00:35:03,167
Apa yang kau pikirkan,
membawa kami padanya, Raww?

749
00:35:03,208 --> 00:35:04,585
Dia aneh sekali.

750
00:35:04,710 --> 00:35:06,378
Apa yang kau pikirkan, memercayainya?

751
00:35:06,587 --> 00:35:07,921
Dia mencurigakan.

752
00:35:08,088 --> 00:35:09,756
Hei, aku tidak mencurigakan.

753
00:35:13,677 --> 00:35:15,512
Yah, dia jorok dan aneh, sih,

754
00:35:15,596 --> 00:35:17,139
tapi bukan mencurigakan.

755
00:35:17,264 --> 00:35:19,057
Hei. Aku punya ide.

756
00:35:19,099 --> 00:35:20,350
- Raww.
- Hah?

757
00:35:20,559 --> 00:35:21,560
Kau bersama kami semalaman, 'kan?

758
00:35:21,685 --> 00:35:23,979
Ya, kurang lebih.

759
00:35:24,104 --> 00:35:25,272
Dia bisa jadi pemandu pulau.

760
00:35:25,355 --> 00:35:27,482
Pemandu pulau? Kau serius?

761
00:35:27,566 --> 00:35:28,734
Ya?

762
00:35:28,901 --> 00:35:30,235
Terima kasih.

763
00:35:30,360 --> 00:35:32,196
Aku akan jadi pemandu pulau terbaik.

764
00:35:32,237 --> 00:35:34,364
Oke. Bisa bantu kami
menelusuri jejak kami?

765
00:35:34,531 --> 00:35:36,450
Oh, ini bakal seperti permainan.

766
00:35:36,617 --> 00:35:38,035
Bukan, Jo. Bukan permainan.

767
00:35:38,202 --> 00:35:40,245
Kita terdampar di pulau monster

768
00:35:40,370 --> 00:35:42,581
dengan manananggal
haus darah memburu kita.

769
00:35:42,706 --> 00:35:44,416
Nyawa kita taruhannya.

770
00:35:44,499 --> 00:35:46,919
Tepat. The Game of Life.

771
00:35:47,044 --> 00:35:48,378
Maksudmu permainan papan itu, 'kan?

772
00:35:48,545 --> 00:35:49,755
Ya, maksudku permainan papan itu.

773
00:35:49,838 --> 00:35:51,506
Kalian pernah main Ro-Sham-Bo?

774
00:35:51,632 --> 00:35:52,674
Aku tak tahu permainan itu.

775
00:35:52,799 --> 00:35:54,259
Seru sekali, lho.

776
00:35:54,384 --> 00:35:56,345
Kau teriak "Ro-Sham-Bo," lalu bergantian

777
00:35:56,428 --> 00:35:58,263
- saling tendang selangkangan.
- Fokus!

778
00:35:58,388 --> 00:36:00,182
Raww, apa yang pertama
kita lakukan semalam?

779
00:36:00,265 --> 00:36:01,767
Oh, benar.

780
00:36:01,975 --> 00:36:04,228
Semalam, aku latihan
otot buat pantai...

781
00:36:04,353 --> 00:36:06,021
9.999.

782
00:36:06,146 --> 00:36:07,731
2.000. Hup!

783
00:36:09,024 --> 00:36:10,817
Tiba-tiba, portal ini terbuka,

784
00:36:10,984 --> 00:36:12,402
dan aku langsung,

785
00:36:12,444 --> 00:36:13,487
"Apa pun yang keluar dari portal itu,

786
00:36:13,654 --> 00:36:14,988
"aku siap bertarung.

787
00:36:15,113 --> 00:36:16,823
Tubuhku siap!"

788
00:36:16,907 --> 00:36:18,700
Ternyata cuma dua manusia biasa.

789
00:36:18,825 --> 00:36:20,452
Benar. Itu kalian.

790
00:36:20,494 --> 00:36:22,871
Kalian bilang, "Wah.
Ini benar-benar Nakali?"

791
00:36:23,080 --> 00:36:24,498
"Itu anjing jadi-jadian?"

792
00:36:24,581 --> 00:36:27,960
Aku bilang, "Yap, anjing
jadi-jadian. Namaku Raww.

793
00:36:28,168 --> 00:36:29,002
"Dan yap lagi.

794
00:36:29,211 --> 00:36:31,463
Ini Pulau Nakali."

795
00:36:31,546 --> 00:36:33,048
Lalu kalian bilang,

796
00:36:33,090 --> 00:36:35,092
"Luar biasa. Tos, yuk. Wapoosh!"

797
00:36:35,175 --> 00:36:37,052
Lalu aku, "Hei, aku juga mau ikut tos.

798
00:36:37,219 --> 00:36:39,388
"Wapoosh! Wapoosh! Wapoosh!

799
00:36:39,554 --> 00:36:43,600
"Wa... poosh!

800
00:36:43,725 --> 00:36:45,477
Wapoosh! Wapoosh! Wapoosh!"

801
00:36:45,560 --> 00:36:47,521
- Raww!
- Oke, ya. Aku paham.

802
00:36:47,646 --> 00:36:48,814
Lalu Jo bilang,

803
00:36:48,897 --> 00:36:50,607
"Ajak kami keliling, Bro.

804
00:36:50,691 --> 00:36:52,192
"Semua orang harus tahu Nakali itu nyata

805
00:36:52,401 --> 00:36:53,819
"dan Lola tidak gila.

806
00:36:53,944 --> 00:36:56,363
Kami harus beli suvenir."

807
00:36:56,530 --> 00:36:58,115
"Serahkan padaku.

808
00:36:58,198 --> 00:37:00,242
Kalian harus ke Pasar Kakaiba."

809
00:37:00,325 --> 00:37:03,078
"Pasar Kakaiba?" "Pasar Kakaiba."

810
00:37:03,245 --> 00:37:04,913
"Kau bilang 'Pasar Kakaiba'?"

811
00:37:05,038 --> 00:37:06,707
"Betul. Pasar Kakaiba!"

812
00:37:06,832 --> 00:37:08,333
Oke, oke. Kami paham.

813
00:37:08,417 --> 00:37:09,960
Kami pergi ke Pasar Kakaiba.

814
00:37:10,043 --> 00:37:12,254
Ya. Menurutmu dari mana
aku dapat mahkota keren itu?

815
00:37:12,421 --> 00:37:13,755
Dan aku suka.

816
00:37:13,839 --> 00:37:15,215
Agar aku tak ketinggalan pesawat,

817
00:37:15,340 --> 00:37:16,675
berarti kita punya

818
00:37:16,842 --> 00:37:18,719
lima jam mencari kunci portal.

819
00:37:18,844 --> 00:37:19,970
- Wah.
- Apa-apaan...

820
00:37:21,763 --> 00:37:23,223
burung raksasa kembali.

821
00:37:23,348 --> 00:37:25,600
Oh, ya. Aku lupa.

822
00:37:25,726 --> 00:37:26,977
Dia tunggangan kita semalam.

823
00:37:27,102 --> 00:37:28,895
Jarang ada yang bisa menjinakkan

824
00:37:29,104 --> 00:37:30,022
burung kilat!

825
00:37:33,400 --> 00:37:34,443
Ro-Sham-Bo!

826
00:37:34,484 --> 00:37:35,819
Anuku...

827
00:37:35,986 --> 00:37:38,780
Aku lupa. Dia cuma mau
dikendarai olehmu, Jo.

828
00:37:38,864 --> 00:37:40,115
Aku?

829
00:37:40,198 --> 00:37:41,116
Keren.

830
00:37:41,283 --> 00:37:43,368
Raissa, aku jalan di atas burung.

831
00:37:43,577 --> 00:37:45,620
Ya. Aku lihat.

832
00:37:46,663 --> 00:37:49,082
Jadi, di mana Pasar Kakaiba ini?

833
00:37:50,584 --> 00:37:51,752
Ayo berangkat.

834
00:37:51,835 --> 00:37:54,171
Yeah!

835
00:38:01,261 --> 00:38:04,473
Ya, pada dasarnya aku
walikota tak resmi tempat ini.

836
00:38:04,681 --> 00:38:07,392
Selamat datang kembali di Pasar Kakaiba!

837
00:38:10,020 --> 00:38:11,396
Lihat!

838
00:38:11,480 --> 00:38:13,648
Wah!

839
00:38:13,774 --> 00:38:14,733
Apa kabar, Eugene?

840
00:38:14,816 --> 00:38:15,901
- Tos.
- Apa kabar?

841
00:38:16,026 --> 00:38:17,527
Nanti saja.

842
00:38:19,446 --> 00:38:21,365
Oke, ini gila.

843
00:38:21,573 --> 00:38:24,451
Banyak sekali aswang.
Persis seperti cerita Lola.

844
00:38:25,869 --> 00:38:28,538
Aku bakal beli banyak barang aneh.

845
00:38:29,790 --> 00:38:30,957
Tidak.

846
00:38:32,667 --> 00:38:34,544
Belanjaanmu mantap, Bro.

847
00:38:34,669 --> 00:38:36,588
- Memang.
- Oke, kembali ke urusan.

848
00:38:36,713 --> 00:38:38,840
Raww, di mana kita dapat
botol ramuan ini semalam?

849
00:38:38,965 --> 00:38:40,467
Oh, serahkan padaku. Lewat sini.

850
00:38:40,634 --> 00:38:42,052
Hah?

851
00:38:43,678 --> 00:38:45,555
Semuanya, bangun! Tao gila itu kembali!

852
00:38:45,764 --> 00:38:46,848
- Hore!
- Oh, asyik!

853
00:38:47,015 --> 00:38:48,767
Hei, Raissa. Rambutmu kenapa?

854
00:38:48,809 --> 00:38:50,727
- Kalah taruhan?
- Hei, mundur.

855
00:38:50,936 --> 00:38:52,479
Kalian lihat ini semalam?

856
00:38:52,687 --> 00:38:54,022
Tidak. Tak lihat.

857
00:38:54,189 --> 00:38:55,399
Tapi langsung saja ke intinya.

858
00:38:55,565 --> 00:38:57,401
Mau barter lagi? Kedip, kedip.

859
00:38:57,567 --> 00:38:59,653
Barter? Apa yang kami barter?

860
00:38:59,694 --> 00:39:00,654
Barang bagus!

861
00:39:00,779 --> 00:39:03,198
Crimson Cow!

862
00:39:03,323 --> 00:39:04,658
Kafeinnya banyak banget.

863
00:39:04,783 --> 00:39:05,992
Kok mereka masih hidup?

864
00:39:08,578 --> 00:39:09,871
Astaga.

865
00:39:10,080 --> 00:39:11,790
Kalian merusak peradaban mereka.

866
00:39:11,832 --> 00:39:13,625
Jadi, ini bisa ditukar apa?

867
00:39:13,708 --> 00:39:15,210
Apa saja yang kau mau.

868
00:39:15,335 --> 00:39:17,254
Ramuan menghilang,
ramuan jujur, ramuan tidur,

869
00:39:17,379 --> 00:39:19,381
mantra cahaya, mantra bunuh,
mantra batal-bunuh.

870
00:39:19,464 --> 00:39:20,966
Terima kasih.

871
00:39:21,091 --> 00:39:23,301
Dah! Asyik!

872
00:39:23,385 --> 00:39:24,886
Ke mana lagi kita semalam?

873
00:39:25,053 --> 00:39:26,430
Dari mana kau dapat mahkota Jo?

874
00:39:26,596 --> 00:39:27,973
Ya.

875
00:39:28,140 --> 00:39:29,933
Kau tahu, kurasa tukang
mahkotaku tak buka hari ini.

876
00:39:30,100 --> 00:39:32,102
- Hah? Hei. Apa?
- Tapi kita harus lihat

877
00:39:32,144 --> 00:39:33,437
lorong kerajinan tangan. Ayo, ayo.

878
00:39:33,603 --> 00:39:34,688
- Balapan, yuk.
- Curang!

879
00:39:34,771 --> 00:39:36,314
- Permisi.
- Hah?

880
00:39:34,854 --> 00:39:36,021
DICURI! KEMBALIKAN!

881
00:39:36,481 --> 00:39:37,732
Kalian lihat tindik puting ini?

882
00:39:37,858 --> 00:39:39,901
Ada yang mencurinya semalam.

883
00:39:40,026 --> 00:39:41,862
Dan itu pusaka keluarga.

884
00:39:42,070 --> 00:39:43,321
Siapa orang mesum ini?!

885
00:39:44,990 --> 00:39:47,284
Jadi, semalam,
di situ kita beli es campur.

886
00:39:47,451 --> 00:39:48,577
Oh, ya.

887
00:39:48,743 --> 00:39:49,911
Di situ kita nonton atraksi tong.

888
00:39:49,953 --> 00:39:50,996
Oh, ya.

889
00:39:51,037 --> 00:39:52,706
Vampir itu menggodaku.

890
00:39:52,831 --> 00:39:54,458
Oh, ya. Dan itu...

891
00:39:54,541 --> 00:39:56,543
- Gawat.
- Apa?

892
00:39:56,626 --> 00:39:58,503
Kalian lihat area di belakangku?

893
00:39:58,628 --> 00:39:59,754
Kios itu?

894
00:39:59,921 --> 00:40:01,214
Yang ada tongkat eskrima keren?

895
00:40:01,339 --> 00:40:02,674
Ya. Kemungkinan besar

896
00:40:02,757 --> 00:40:04,301
kita lewat toko itu semalam.

897
00:40:04,426 --> 00:40:07,971
Dan, yah, kalau aku terlalu
dekat dengan tongkat, aku jadi...

898
00:40:08,096 --> 00:40:09,097
anjing total.

899
00:40:10,474 --> 00:40:11,933
- Anjing total?
- Ya.

900
00:40:12,017 --> 00:40:14,102
Kalau itu terjadi, semuanya jadi samar,

901
00:40:14,227 --> 00:40:15,604
dan yang kuingat cuma tongkat.

902
00:40:15,729 --> 00:40:17,189
Tongkat dikejar, tongkat dikunyah,

903
00:40:17,314 --> 00:40:18,315
tongkat dikencingi.

904
00:40:18,398 --> 00:40:19,983
Kasihan kau.

905
00:40:20,066 --> 00:40:21,485
Tidak, jangan kasihan.

906
00:40:21,651 --> 00:40:23,028
Dia seharusnya jadi pemandu pulau kita.

907
00:40:23,195 --> 00:40:25,155
Bagaimana dia bantu kita mengingat semalam

908
00:40:25,322 --> 00:40:28,116
kalau dia sendiri tak ingat semalam?!

909
00:40:28,200 --> 00:40:31,453
Jadi, kalian mau beli sesuatu atau...?

910
00:40:31,495 --> 00:40:32,871
Hei! Raissa!

911
00:40:32,913 --> 00:40:34,706
Jo! Di sini!

912
00:40:34,915 --> 00:40:35,999
Kalian lihat aku?

913
00:40:36,082 --> 00:40:38,585
Raissa, itu tiyanak.

914
00:40:38,793 --> 00:40:40,253
Itu bayi iblis yang besar.

915
00:40:40,378 --> 00:40:42,756
Oh, jangan si popok gendut ini.

916
00:40:42,881 --> 00:40:45,884
Dia menenun apa yang dia lihat
pakai tangan mungilnya yang bodoh.

917
00:40:45,967 --> 00:40:47,511
Hai. Hai.

918
00:40:47,636 --> 00:40:49,221
Selamat datang kembali.

919
00:40:49,304 --> 00:40:50,805
Oh, lihat.

920
00:40:50,972 --> 00:40:53,099
Permadani baru laris manis.

921
00:40:53,141 --> 00:40:54,351
Wah.

922
00:40:54,434 --> 00:40:55,769
Semua orang suka.

923
00:40:55,977 --> 00:40:57,062
- Tapi ini...
- Hah?

924
00:40:57,145 --> 00:40:58,563
...tak ada yang suka.

925
00:40:58,772 --> 00:41:02,234
Kau anjing nakal karena
kau jahat pada semua orang.

926
00:41:02,442 --> 00:41:04,778
Apa? Dia tak tahu apa yang dia bicarakan.

927
00:41:04,861 --> 00:41:06,613
Raww! Kau tak boleh di sini.

928
00:41:06,738 --> 00:41:08,949
Kau pikir bisa seenaknya
masuk ke toko kami

929
00:41:09,115 --> 00:41:10,367
dan mengencingi barang kami?

930
00:41:10,492 --> 00:41:12,202
Aku menandainya. Itu milikku.

931
00:41:12,410 --> 00:41:14,412
Kenapa lagi namanya "pasar," Paolo?

932
00:41:14,579 --> 00:41:16,248
Tuh, 'kan? Anjing nakal.

933
00:41:16,289 --> 00:41:17,666
Pembohong!

934
00:41:17,791 --> 00:41:20,377
Bilang aku baik, atau kupo...

935
00:41:21,753 --> 00:41:25,048
Bilang aku baik, atau kurobek
lubang pantatmu, Pantat!

936
00:41:26,341 --> 00:41:29,553
Namaku bukan Pantat. Namaku Bungi.

937
00:41:29,636 --> 00:41:32,806
Namaku dari mamaku yang
manis dan cantik, Bungina.

938
00:41:32,973 --> 00:41:34,724
Selamat datang.
Aku Bungina.

939
00:41:34,808 --> 00:41:36,142
Aku sayang anakku.

940
00:41:36,268 --> 00:41:37,852
Dan aku sayang Mama.

941
00:41:37,936 --> 00:41:40,939
Bro, bisa berhenti mencuri pisauku?

942
00:41:40,981 --> 00:41:42,566
Terserah. Kita tak butuh dia.

943
00:41:42,691 --> 00:41:44,109
Aku bisa mengingat.

944
00:41:44,276 --> 00:41:45,318
Ingat.

945
00:41:45,485 --> 00:41:46,653
Ngi-ngat.

946
00:41:46,778 --> 00:41:48,822
Ingus.

947
00:41:48,905 --> 00:41:51,408
Pokoknya, Bungi, kami kehilangan ingatan.

948
00:41:51,575 --> 00:41:52,993
Aduh. Sudah periksa sakumu?

949
00:41:53,076 --> 00:41:54,619
Kasihan sekali kalian.

950
00:41:56,204 --> 00:41:57,622
Bisa ceritakan apa yang terjadi?

951
00:41:57,831 --> 00:42:00,375
Aku bisa menunjukkan kejadian semalam.

952
00:42:00,458 --> 00:42:03,545
Aku merekam semua yang kulihat di pasar.

953
00:42:03,670 --> 00:42:06,339
Dan yang ini seru sekali.

954
00:42:06,548 --> 00:42:09,843
Yakin perut fanamu kuat
menahan bumbu aswang berapi?

955
00:42:11,261 --> 00:42:12,762
Bro, aku sarapan makanan pedas berapi.

956
00:42:12,846 --> 00:42:14,472
Bawa sini!

957
00:42:14,639 --> 00:42:15,974
Ha!

958
00:42:16,182 --> 00:42:17,642
Tuh, 'kan? Tak masa...

959
00:42:21,396 --> 00:42:22,355
Ini kau?

960
00:42:22,480 --> 00:42:24,524
Kau muntah api di rambutku?

961
00:42:24,649 --> 00:42:27,652
Bukan. Jauh lebih parah.

962
00:42:30,614 --> 00:42:32,407
Jo, kau tak apa-apa?

963
00:42:32,574 --> 00:42:33,658
Maafkan aku.

964
00:42:35,327 --> 00:42:37,370
Kau mencret api di rambutnya.

965
00:42:37,579 --> 00:42:38,747
Klasik.

966
00:42:41,041 --> 00:42:42,709
Halo. Ya.

967
00:42:42,834 --> 00:42:44,544
- Aku mau melupakan kenangan ini lagi.
- Apa?

968
00:42:44,753 --> 00:42:48,006
Itu momen paling seru di sini sejak lama.

969
00:42:48,131 --> 00:42:49,674
Senang bisa tertawa lagi.

970
00:42:49,758 --> 00:42:52,135
Biasanya kalau ada yang terbakar,

971
00:42:52,177 --> 00:42:55,847
itu karena Manang membakarnya hidup-hidup.

972
00:42:56,056 --> 00:42:57,682
Wajahku meleleh!

973
00:42:57,807 --> 00:42:59,267
Kulitku mudah terbakar!

974
00:42:59,351 --> 00:43:02,312
Jadi, ya, kami menghargai api yang lucu.

975
00:43:02,479 --> 00:43:05,649
Tuh, Raissa? Semua orang senang.

976
00:43:05,732 --> 00:43:07,609
Kecuali dia.

977
00:43:09,027 --> 00:43:10,278
Oh, ya.

978
00:43:10,362 --> 00:43:12,530
- Duwende itu marah sekali.
- Gawat.

979
00:43:12,697 --> 00:43:15,158
Lola-mu selalu bilang
jangan meremehkan duwende.

980
00:43:15,325 --> 00:43:17,619
Bukan sembarang duwende. Raja duwende.

981
00:43:17,744 --> 00:43:19,996
Dia bilang soal kau merenggut martabatnya.

982
00:43:20,163 --> 00:43:22,290
Jadi dia akan mengambil sesuatu darimu:

983
00:43:22,415 --> 00:43:24,834
Permata Laut Berhargamu.

984
00:43:25,001 --> 00:43:27,003
