00:52:51,234 --> 00:52:52,360
Kodenya.

1225
00:52:52,401 --> 00:52:54,070
Kalau tak kencing,
tak dianggap.

1226
00:52:54,153 --> 00:52:55,529
Yah, aku melihatmu.

1227
00:52:55,613 --> 00:52:57,907
Aku tahu, tapi Raissa kenapa?

1228
00:52:58,032 --> 00:53:00,034
Maksudku, semalam di Desa Kapre,

1229
00:53:00,159 --> 00:53:01,285
kami sangat akrab.

1230
00:53:01,452 --> 00:53:02,328
Lihat kami.

1231
00:53:02,495 --> 00:53:04,372
- Aw.
- Tapi hari ini,

1232
00:53:04,497 --> 00:53:06,082
dia tak mau ada urusan denganku.

1233
00:53:07,541 --> 00:53:09,293
Aku paham maksudmu.

1234
00:53:09,335 --> 00:53:10,711
Kau lihat jimat ini?

1235
00:53:10,836 --> 00:53:12,630
Waktu kami umur sepuluh,

1236
00:53:12,797 --> 00:53:14,840
kubuatkan Raissa mixtape,
mixtape pertama kami.

1237
00:53:16,968 --> 00:53:19,053
Aku berjam-jam menunggu di depan radio

1238
00:53:19,262 --> 00:53:21,138
untuk merekam lagu kesukaan Raissa.

1239
00:53:21,180 --> 00:53:22,974
Wah, baik sekali kau.

1240
00:53:23,182 --> 00:53:24,016
Memang.

1241
00:53:24,225 --> 00:53:25,351
Dan dia suka.

1242
00:53:25,476 --> 00:53:26,769
- Siapa yang tidak?
- Ya, 'kan?

1243
00:53:26,936 --> 00:53:29,647
Tapi suatu hari kuputar,
dan isinya hilang.

1244
00:53:29,772 --> 00:53:32,775
Raissa menimpanya
dengan catatan belajar payah.

1245
00:53:32,858 --> 00:53:34,819
Entah karena Flame-O's atau ceritanya,

1246
00:53:34,986 --> 00:53:36,779
- aku jadi mau nangis.
- Jangan sentuh mata.

1247
00:53:36,862 --> 00:53:38,239
Aduh, mataku!

1248
00:53:38,281 --> 00:53:40,324
Katanya tak sengaja, tapi entahlah.

1249
00:53:40,366 --> 00:53:42,076
Karena tadi Raissa bahkan tak ingat

1250
00:53:42,243 --> 00:53:43,202
jimat mixtape itu untuk apa.

1251
00:53:43,369 --> 00:53:44,829
Parah itu.

1252
00:53:44,996 --> 00:53:48,124
Dan nanti, persahabatan kami
akan seperti mixtape itu.

1253
00:53:48,291 --> 00:53:49,542
Terhapus.

1254
00:53:49,667 --> 00:53:52,044
Ditimpa sekolah baru Raissa,

1255
00:53:52,169 --> 00:53:54,088
teman baru, hidup baru.

1256
00:53:54,130 --> 00:53:56,632
- Hilang!
- Seperti angin lalu.

1257
00:53:56,757 --> 00:53:58,384
Aku tak mau jadi kentut tertiup angin.

1258
00:53:58,509 --> 00:54:00,386
- Kau harus meninggalkan jejak.
- Benar. Aku harus...

1259
00:54:00,469 --> 00:54:02,471
Kencingi barang-barangnya! Semuanya!

1260
00:54:02,638 --> 00:54:04,015
Apa? Bukan.

1261
00:54:04,140 --> 00:54:06,100
Kita harus membawa Raissa
kembali ke Desa Kapre.

1262
00:54:06,183 --> 00:54:08,602
Dan mengingatkannya betapa serunya...

1263
00:54:08,769 --> 00:54:11,230
betapa istimewanya semalam.

1264
00:54:11,355 --> 00:54:12,523
Betapa istimewa kita!

1265
00:54:12,565 --> 00:54:13,691
Ke Desa Kapre!

1266
00:54:13,733 --> 00:54:14,942
- Ya!
- Ya!

1267
00:54:15,067 --> 00:54:17,653
Wapoosh! Wapoosh! Wapoosh!

1268
00:54:18,779 --> 00:54:21,782
Kata Mama, jangan sampai kena sakit mata,

1269
00:54:21,907 --> 00:54:23,492
dan kau malah kena sakit mata.

1270
00:54:23,576 --> 00:54:24,744
Bungi bodoh.

1271
00:54:24,785 --> 00:54:26,912
Kau tak akan kena sakit mata, Bungi.

1272
00:54:27,079 --> 00:54:28,748
Oh, enak.

1273
00:54:28,789 --> 00:54:30,374
Ya, sedikit lagi.

1274
00:54:30,416 --> 00:54:32,209
Lagi. Lagi!

1275
00:54:32,251 --> 00:54:33,711
Hei!

1276
00:54:33,919 --> 00:54:36,672
Kenapa benda-benda
ini tak mau lepas dariku?!

1277
00:54:36,797 --> 00:54:39,383
Mungkin karena kau baik sekali.

1278
00:54:39,508 --> 00:54:41,260
- Apa?
- Ya.

1279
00:54:41,385 --> 00:54:42,845
Bayangkan rasanya jadi sayap-sayap itu,

1280
00:54:43,012 --> 00:54:47,141
menempel pada vampir iblis itu, Manang.

1281
00:54:47,266 --> 00:54:48,434
Nasaán ká?
(Kau dimana?)

1282
00:54:48,559 --> 00:54:50,519
Begitu banyak amarah.

1283
00:54:50,686 --> 00:54:53,773
Nasaán ká? Nasaán ká?

1284
00:54:58,861 --> 00:55:01,572
Semua orang lari ketakutan darinya.

1285
00:55:01,739 --> 00:55:04,075
Satu-satunya temannya:

1286
00:55:04,158 --> 00:55:06,243
pikiran-pikiran kelamnya.

1287
00:55:06,410 --> 00:55:07,703
Saan ká nasaán?
Mereka mengambil dari kita.

1288
00:55:07,870 --> 00:55:10,164
Ruang gema kegilaan.

1289
00:55:10,206 --> 00:55:12,041
Selalu mengambil dari kita.

1290
00:55:12,208 --> 00:55:13,876
Mereka mengambil dari kita.

1291
00:55:14,001 --> 00:55:15,002
Selalu mengambil.

1292
00:55:15,169 --> 00:55:16,545
Akan kutemukan kau.

1293
00:55:17,671 --> 00:55:19,256
Tanpa teman.

1294
00:55:19,465 --> 00:55:20,883
Tanpa keluarga.

1295
00:55:21,050 --> 00:55:24,720
- Dan hobinya cuma membunuh.
- Akin ka (Kau milikku).

1296
00:55:25,930 --> 00:55:28,140
Baiklah.

1297
00:55:28,224 --> 00:55:30,059
Kau tak apa-apa?

1298
00:55:30,184 --> 00:55:32,311
Ya, baik. Bisa kita jalan?

1299
00:55:32,353 --> 00:55:34,688
Akhirnya! Ke Teluk Mutiara.

1300
00:55:34,855 --> 00:55:36,732
Desa Kapre.

1301
00:55:38,818 --> 00:55:41,153
Legenda tak pernah mati!

1302
00:55:44,323 --> 00:55:46,909
Bukannya kita harusnya sudah sampai?

1303
00:55:46,992 --> 00:55:48,536
Bungi, peta ini akurat?

1304
00:55:48,577 --> 00:55:50,413
Tentu saja. Mama yang buat.

1305
00:55:50,538 --> 00:55:52,665
Kau bilang mamaku pembohong?

1306
00:55:52,748 --> 00:55:55,418
Tak ada yang membicarakan mamamu.

1307
00:55:55,501 --> 00:55:58,003
Maaf, aku agak lewel.

1308
00:55:58,170 --> 00:55:59,630
Sudah jam tidur siang.

1309
00:55:59,755 --> 00:56:01,507
- Bisa mampir dulu...
- Tak ada mampir.

1310
00:56:03,300 --> 00:56:04,593
Kita sampai.

1311
00:56:04,802 --> 00:56:07,096
Ini bukan Teluk Mutiara.

1312
00:56:07,221 --> 00:56:08,305
Ini rawa.

1313
00:56:08,431 --> 00:56:10,808
Kita di mana?

1314
00:56:10,975 --> 00:56:12,685
Desa Kapre.

1315
00:56:12,810 --> 00:56:13,978
Diam kau, Teen Wolf.

1316
00:56:14,061 --> 00:56:17,022
Jo, kenapa kita di Desa Kapre?

1317
00:56:17,064 --> 00:56:18,524
Cuma mampir sebentar.

1318
00:56:18,649 --> 00:56:20,359
Seperti misi sampingan.

1319
00:56:21,569 --> 00:56:23,028
Dan kita tahu di mana kunci portalnya.

1320
00:56:23,237 --> 00:56:24,780
Kita tahu lokasinya.

1321
00:56:26,031 --> 00:56:27,366
Lagi pula, waktu masih ada.

1322
00:56:27,533 --> 00:56:29,368
Waktu kita banyak banget.

1323
00:56:30,369 --> 00:56:31,579
Tahu tidak? Kau benar.

1324
00:56:31,704 --> 00:56:33,289
Aku lupa, kita pakai jam Jo.

1325
00:56:33,330 --> 00:56:35,958
Hei, Bungi, kau tidur siang saja sana.

1326
00:56:36,041 --> 00:56:37,293
Ooh.

1327
00:56:37,418 --> 00:56:39,587
Karena di jam Jo, tak ada yang penting.

1328
00:56:39,628 --> 00:56:41,130
Seperti mengejar pesawat...

1329
00:56:41,297 --> 00:56:42,673
...atau mencuri sayap iblis...

1330
00:56:42,882 --> 00:56:44,967
...atau mampir seru yang membuat kita...

1331
00:56:45,134 --> 00:56:47,470
...diburai isi perutnya
oleh vampir sinting!

1332
00:56:47,511 --> 00:56:48,595
WILD PACK

1333
00:56:47,595 --> 00:56:50,389
Satu lagi pengalaman tak terlupakan

1334
00:56:50,598 --> 00:56:52,933
persembahan jam Jo.

1335
00:56:54,101 --> 00:56:55,519
Aku lupa soal...

1336
00:56:55,686 --> 00:56:59,023
Raissa, sekali ini,
bisa berhenti dan lihat sekeliling?

1337
00:56:59,231 --> 00:57:00,691
Kita di Nakali,

1338
00:57:00,816 --> 00:57:02,943
tempat yang kita impikan sejak kecil.

1339
00:57:03,027 --> 00:57:06,572
Dan sekarang kita benar-benar
menjalani mimpi kita.

1340
00:57:06,739 --> 00:57:08,032
Ini bukan mimpi, Jo.

1341
00:57:08,240 --> 00:57:09,533
Ini mimpi buruk.

1342
00:57:09,700 --> 00:57:11,577
Mimpi buruk?

1343
00:57:11,744 --> 00:57:13,996
Kita nongkrong bareng kapre.

1344
00:57:14,121 --> 00:57:16,540
Kapre yang sama yang menyambut Lola.

1345
00:57:16,624 --> 00:57:18,209
Dan kita tak bisa mengingatnya.

1346
00:57:18,292 --> 00:57:20,336
Kau tak terganggu?

1347
00:57:20,461 --> 00:57:21,587
Sayang sekali.

1348
00:57:21,754 --> 00:57:23,088
Kalian tak ingat kami?

1349
00:57:23,130 --> 00:57:25,299
- Hah?
- Ini aku, Datu.

1350
00:57:25,466 --> 00:57:27,718
Kau kapre.

1351
00:57:27,801 --> 00:57:28,928
Raissa, itu kapre.

1352
00:57:29,053 --> 00:57:30,721
Datu, tos di sini.

1353
00:57:30,846 --> 00:57:32,181
Ha! Raissa.

1354
00:57:32,389 --> 00:57:33,766
Meleset dari tanganku.

1355
00:57:33,891 --> 00:57:36,685
Kau mencuri sayap itu,
persis seperti janjimu.

1356
00:57:36,852 --> 00:57:38,479
Apa? Bukan.

1357
00:57:38,562 --> 00:57:40,564
Bukan aku. Itu semua ulah Jo.

1358
00:57:40,689 --> 00:57:41,815
Bukan!

1359
00:57:43,150 --> 00:57:44,568
Itu jelas idemu, Raissa.

1360
00:57:44,652 --> 00:57:46,570
Dia gila.

1361
00:57:48,864 --> 00:57:50,449
Kau mencuri sayap Manang?

1362
00:57:50,574 --> 00:57:53,244
- Bukan, aku...
- Itu ulahmu, Kawan.

1363
00:57:53,369 --> 00:57:54,954
Tapi aku... Bukan.

1364
00:57:55,079 --> 00:57:58,290
Desa bakal heboh melihat sayap ini.

1365
00:57:58,415 --> 00:57:59,959
Tenang.

1366
00:58:00,000 --> 00:58:01,418
Ini akan sangat sepadan.

1367
00:58:01,502 --> 00:58:04,755
Jo, kita harus kembali... pulang.

1368
00:58:04,922 --> 00:58:06,966
Ah, mereka kembali.

1369
00:58:07,007 --> 00:58:09,802
- Oh, lihat.
- Dia dapat sayapnya.

1370
00:58:09,885 --> 00:58:11,971
- Selamat datang!
- Hei, bung.

1371
00:58:12,054 --> 00:58:14,390
Jangan diam saja. Ambilkan mereka makanan.

1372
00:58:14,598 --> 00:58:16,809
- Terima kasih. Hai.
- Selamat datang!

1373
00:58:19,353 --> 00:58:21,105
Kubilang kita di sini semalam.

1374
00:58:21,313 --> 00:58:22,398
Yum Yum Bird?

1375
00:58:24,233 --> 00:58:25,401
Ate Jo!

1376
00:58:25,484 --> 00:58:26,902
Ate Raissa!

1377
00:58:28,195 --> 00:58:29,363
Apa kabar, Bocah-bocah?

1378
00:58:29,446 --> 00:58:30,656
Kau dapat sayapnya!

1379
00:58:30,781 --> 00:58:32,241
Boleh kupakai?

1380
00:58:32,283 --> 00:58:34,159
Aku menjaga benda paling berhargamu.

1381
00:58:34,285 --> 00:58:36,579
Norke-ku! Aku cemas sekali.

1382
00:58:36,745 --> 00:58:39,164
Kalian berdua meninggalkan kesan mendalam

1383
00:58:39,373 --> 00:58:40,958
di desa kami semalam.

1384
00:58:41,000 --> 00:58:43,586
Tito (Om) Datu,
ceritakan semua soal semalam.

1385
00:58:43,752 --> 00:58:46,005
Terutama soal Raissa dapat sayapnya.

1386
00:58:46,213 --> 00:58:47,172
Teluk Mutiara bagaimana?

1387
00:58:47,339 --> 00:58:48,340
- Tak ada yang peduli!
- Ah!

1388
00:58:48,382 --> 00:58:49,842
Siapa mau dengar cerita?

1389
00:58:49,967 --> 00:58:52,011
- Aku!
- Aku. Ceritakan.

1390
00:58:52,177 --> 00:58:53,012
Ceritakan!

1391
00:58:54,221 --> 00:58:55,556
Itu bayi iblis yang besar.

1392
00:58:55,723 --> 00:58:58,225
Oke. Sepertinya sudah waktunya bercerita.

1393
00:58:58,309 --> 00:58:59,810
- Asyik!
- Bukan asyik.

1394
00:58:59,935 --> 00:59:02,563
Jo, kita tak punya waktu untuk ini.

1395
00:59:02,646 --> 00:59:05,274
Semalam, dua tao ini memberi kami

1396
00:59:05,357 --> 00:59:07,693
salah satu kenangan terindah kami

1397
00:59:07,818 --> 00:59:11,697
dengan memperkenalkan kami
pada keajaiban karaoke.

1398
00:59:11,822 --> 00:59:14,116
Karaoke.

1399
00:59:14,325 --> 00:59:16,535
Keceriaan kalian bahkan mengundang aswang

1400
00:59:16,619 --> 00:59:19,204
dari seluruh pulau, hal langka bagi kami.

1401
00:59:19,246 --> 00:59:20,623
Ayo, Nakali!

1402
00:59:20,706 --> 00:59:22,166
Mana suaranya!

1403
00:59:22,333 --> 00:59:25,628
Jangan berhenti percaya

1404
00:59:26,754 --> 00:59:29,381
Genggam erat rasa itu

1405
00:59:29,590 --> 00:59:32,718
Lampu jalan, orang-orang

1406
00:59:32,760 --> 00:59:35,429
Oh-oh-oh

1407
00:59:35,554 --> 00:59:37,806
Indah sekali, bung.

1408
00:59:37,890 --> 00:59:40,184
Terlalu indah.

1409
00:59:41,977 --> 00:59:43,312
Itu Manang!

1410
00:59:43,479 --> 00:59:45,648
Lindungi anak-anak!

1411
00:59:47,274 --> 00:59:48,901
Manang jiwa yang tersesat.

1412
00:59:49,026 --> 00:59:50,194
Dia tak punya desa.

1413
00:59:50,402 --> 00:59:52,071
Hanya kesengsaraannya.

1414
00:59:52,279 --> 00:59:54,782
Harusnya ada yang menyiram
penyihir jahat itu.

1415
00:59:54,948 --> 00:59:58,369
Yah, Raissa, dia punya rencana lain.

1416
00:59:58,494 --> 01:00:00,245
Semua orang lari.

1417
01:00:00,412 --> 01:00:03,582
Kecuali tao gila itu.

1418
01:00:03,791 --> 01:00:05,000
Kau membela kami!

1419
01:00:06,210 --> 01:00:08,671
Mari lihat bagaimana sistem
terbang bersayap banyaknya

1420
01:00:08,837 --> 01:00:11,090
berfungsi tanpa mekanisme dorong utama.

1421
01:00:11,173 --> 01:00:13,592
Mustahil. Kau mau merampas sayapnya?

1422
01:00:13,801 --> 01:00:16,720
Aku mau merampas sayapnya!

1423
01:00:16,845 --> 01:00:19,431
Rampas sayapnya! Rampas sayapnya!

1424
01:00:19,515 --> 01:00:21,892
Sayapnya dirampas! Sayapnya dirampas!

1425
01:00:21,975 --> 01:00:23,602
Ate Raissa,

1426
01:00:23,727 --> 01:00:24,853
ini untukmu.

1427
01:00:24,978 --> 01:00:27,022
Terima kasih sudah melawan Manang.

1428
01:00:32,069 --> 01:00:35,489
Kau benar-benar mirip
sekali dengan lola-mu.

1429
01:00:35,572 --> 01:00:37,741
Raissa, itu Lola.

1430
01:00:37,866 --> 01:00:38,951
Mustahil.

1431
01:00:38,992 --> 01:00:40,786
Lola-mu adalah

1432
01:00:40,869 --> 01:00:43,163
satu-satunya tao lain
yang datang ke desa kami,

1433
01:00:43,330 --> 01:00:45,541
dan dia sama gilanya denganmu.

1434
01:00:46,875 --> 01:00:48,001
Aku rindu dia.

1435
01:00:49,503 --> 01:00:51,463
Kami para kapre punya pepatah:

1436
01:00:51,630 --> 01:00:55,092
"Sejauh apa pun kita terpisah,
kita akan selalu bersama."

1437
01:00:55,217 --> 01:00:57,302
"Jika kita mengingat."

1438
01:01:00,222 --> 01:01:02,516
Kau benar membawa kita kembali ke sini,

1439
01:01:02,683 --> 01:01:04,685
karena kita menjalani mimpi kita.

1440
01:01:04,810 --> 01:01:06,562
Dan aku tak mau melupakan ini.

1441
01:01:07,730 --> 01:01:08,981
Pilih satu.

1442
01:01:19,908 --> 01:01:21,702
Wah.

1443
01:01:21,910 --> 01:01:24,288
Raissa, kau yang melakukan ini?

1444
01:01:24,329 --> 01:01:25,247
Melakukan apa?

1445
01:01:27,124 --> 01:01:29,334
Mereka terbang!

1446
01:01:29,501 --> 01:01:30,461
Indah!

1447
01:01:36,425 --> 01:01:39,386
Raww, kenapa lama sekali?

1448
01:01:43,182 --> 01:01:44,808
Raissa, awas!

1449
01:01:46,018 --> 01:01:48,562
Gawat.

1450
01:01:51,482 --> 01:01:52,816
Raww?

1451
01:02:14,087 --> 01:02:15,923
Jeda. Jangan bunuh aku.

1452
01:02:17,424 --> 01:02:19,968
Tita Manang, soal sayap ini

1453
01:02:20,052 --> 01:02:22,012
cuma salah paham.

1454
01:02:22,095 --> 01:02:23,597
Kami penggemar berat.

1455
01:02:23,680 --> 01:02:25,641
Lihat!

1456
01:02:27,184 --> 01:02:29,353
Wah. Kau tak perlu berbuat apa-apa

1457
01:02:29,436 --> 01:02:32,105
dan tetap seram banget.

1458
01:02:33,273 --> 01:02:35,317
Kami minta maaf!

1459
01:02:35,442 --> 01:02:38,237
Seharusnya kami tak meminjam sayapmu.

1460
01:02:38,362 --> 01:02:40,072
Tolong ambil kembali.

1461
01:02:40,239 --> 01:02:41,949
Kalian tak bisa ikut aku.

1462
01:02:43,700 --> 01:02:45,202
